        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: NBA 2K16\n- People: Tony Parker, Dennis Schröder, Marc Gasol, Pau Gasol\n- Companies/Teams: San Antonio Spurs, Atlanta Hawks, Memphis Grizzlies, Chicago Bulls\n- Roles: Cover athletes, point guard\n- Places/Languages: French version, German version, Spanish version\n\nFacts:\n- The French version of NBA 2K16 features Tony Parker of the San Antonio Spurs as the cover athlete.\n- The German version of NBA 2K16 features Dennis Schröder of the Atlanta Hawks as the cover athlete.\n- The Spanish version of NBA 2K16 features Marc Gasol of the Memphis Grizzlies and Pau Gasol of the Chicago Bulls as cover athletes.\n- Dennis Schröder plays the point guard position.",
